2. opencl/english.txt (and the wordlist in opencl/embedded.h)
   The BIP-0039 English wordlist (https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/blob/master/bip-0039/english.txt),
   verified by its SHA-256.

3. opencl/src/addresses.c
   The code-cell hash of the TON wallet contract v5r1 is taken from @ton/ton (MIT License).

4. opencl/third_party/ed25519/
   ed25519-donna (https://github.com/floodyberry/ed25519-donna), public domain by Andrew M.
   (liquidsun@gmail.com), modified from the amd64-51-30k implementation by Daniel J. Bernstein,
   Niels Duif, Tanja Lange, Peter Schwabe and Bo-Yin Yang (see
   opencl/third_party/ed25519/README.md). Only the field and group arithmetic is used, for
   Ed25519 public-key derivation: the independent CPU check of every hit and the fixed-base
   table for the GPU kernel.

5. opencl/ed25519_gpu.cl
   The field arithmetic (radix 2^25.5, ten 32-bit limbs, multiplication and inversion chains)
   and the twisted-Edwards addition formulas follow the public-domain ref10 implementation by
   Daniel J. Bernstein, Niels Duif, Tanja Lange, Peter Schwabe and Bo-Yin Yang.
